than us though.

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:26.990
Sure.

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:32.740
[inaudible] in and of itself, a multi-party
system is, is not always better in all cases,

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:34.720
but I think we should be asking all of these
questions.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.120
